                                "sense_id": "fbfba9ba-3294-3256-af7b-082983e6ea19",
                                "text": "One song the group performed on Thursday, “La Partida,” featured lovely bell harmonics from the guitars, a shifting pattern of cross‐rhythms on the guitar‐like charango, and a quena lead."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f05eeb1-ca96-4ceb-889a-8fe2c7056469",
                                "sense_id": "fbfba9ba-3294-3256-af7b-082983e6ea19",
                                "text": "As the band’s traditional instrumentalist, Yuri Callisaya, shrilled on the quena, the band’s fans sang along with Mr. Méndez: “Ama sua, ama llulla, ama quella,” which translates as, “Don’t steal, don’t lie, don’t be lazy.”"
